{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"接着做眼前该做的事承接了S11-6已经作出的争取决定，久违的昂扬对应B1，没有把珠子的步伐比喻写成实际场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"保留了v6中不再要求努力改变一切的实质，并用量力而行说清新的行动态度，没有越界。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"舍不得的生活和愿意承担责任都有前文及v6依据，也清楚写出了牵挂不再妨碍行动的转变。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"以争取可能伤到珍视的生活作为不安的心理原因，再写带着不安继续行动，没有把音乐色彩变化当成心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-6已经决定带着害怕去争取，直接支撑这一段继续行动和重新昂扬。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"行动的力量不能消除牵挂，能说明行动有局限，但没有直接推出不再要求每次努力改变一切。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"两样都舍不得却难免伤及其中一样，确实构成了不再要求努力解决一切的理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-4已经明确他舍不得行动带来的力量和那种生活带来的安慰，这份双重牵挂继续支撑当前选择。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"不争取就护不住珍惜的东西，直接解释了他为什么愿意承担责任并继续行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"想到代价便疼、盼着别失去太多，足以解释这次面对争取时的动摇。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-6已经明确了即使害怕也要争取的决定，直接支撑这里不安之后仍然向前。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-1提供了不等心里完全明白便先行动的早期先例，但没有直接解释当前决定，眼下的直接前因其实是S11-6。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"能读出从继续行动、降低对行动的要求，到明确珍惜什么、带着不安仍然坚持的完整过程，不看珠子也能理解。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-3\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"why\": \"三条连续重复继续做眼前的事这一意思，尤其S12-3的所以继续做眼前该做的事与S12-1几乎重合，S12-4则再次写往前做；S12-4保留动摇后仍行动的作用，S12-3的尾句可以删掉。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a19a1448-4983-45a0-88b2-ada0e9dfa6c2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003740378859Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.359, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:38:58.751696+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a6d472f98d1ac311f9c82c1a387490f34d54b9b3a271b860003bdc0ae3599142", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T00374